---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../sections/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../sections/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <Header />
  
  <main class="bg-[#faf1db] pt-32 pb-32 px-6 md:px-12 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto space-y-24 md:space-y-32">
      
      <section class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 animate-fade-in-up">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 flex flex-col justify-center">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-[#028598]/70 mb-2 uppercase">Restaurante de Autor</p>
          <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold text-[#028598] mb-6 drop-shadow-sm">Sabores de Andamán</h1>
          <p class="text-[#028598]/80 text-lg font-light leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Ubicado a la orilla del mar, nuestro restaurante rinde homenaje a la rica herencia culinaria de Tailandia fusionada con técnicas contemporáneas. Utilizamos exclusivamente mariscos frescos de pesca local y vegetales cultivados en nuestro propio huerto orgánico.
          </p>
          <p class="text-[#028598]/80 text-lg font-light leading-relaxed">
            Una experiencia donde cada bocado cuenta la historia de la isla, diseñada para deleitar los paladares más exigentes mientras disfrutan de la brisa del mar.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 relative h-80 md:h-[500px] rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-xl group">
          <img src="/restaurant-intro.webp" alt="Restaurante Maya Bay" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.03]" />
        </div>
      </section>

      <hr class="w-2/3 md:w-1/2 mx-auto border-t-2 border-[#028598]/15 rounded-full" />

      <section class="text-center animate-fade-in-up">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#028598] mb-16">Nuestros Creadores</h2>
        
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-center gap-16 md:gap-24">
          <div class="group flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-48 h-48 rounded-full overflow-hidden shadow-lg mb-6 transform transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:-translate-y-2 group-hover:shadow-2xl border-4 border-[#028598]/10">
              <img src="/chef-1.webp" alt="Chef Ejecutivo" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" />
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#028598]">Krit Boonsri</h3>
            <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-[#028598]/60 font-semibold mb-3">Chef Ejecutivo</p>
            <p class="text-[#028598]/80 max-w-xs font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Con más de 15 años de experiencia en restaurantes con estrellas Michelin, Krit lidera nuestra cocina transformando recetas familiares en alta gastronomía.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="group flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="w-48 h-48 rounded-full overflow-hidden shadow-lg mb-6 transform transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:-translate-y-2 group-hover:shadow-2xl border-4 border-[#028598]/10">
              <img src="/chef-2.webp" alt="Sous Chef" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" />
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#028598]">Mali Vong</h3>
            <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-[#028598]/60 font-semibold mb-3">Sous Chef y Repostería</p>
            <p class="text-[#028598]/80 max-w-xs font-light text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Maestra de la delicadeza. Mali es la mente maestra detrás de nuestros postres tropicales y de la impecable presentación de cada plato.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <hr class="w-2/3 md:w-1/2 mx-auto border-t-2 border-[#028598]/15 rounded-full" />

      <section class="animate-fade-in-up bg-[#028598] rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 md:p-16 shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(2,133,152,0.3)] text-[#faf1db]">
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Menú de Degustación</h2>
          <p class="text-[#faf1db]/80 font-light max-w-xl mx-auto">
            Un viaje de 5 tiempos diseñado para recorrer la esencia de Tailandia.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-8">
          
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-baseline border-b border-[#faf1db]/20 pb-4 group">
            <div class="w-full md:w-3/4">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#faf1db]/60 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Primer Tiempo</span>
              <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-yellow-100">Amuse-Bouche del Mar</h4>
              <p class="text-sm font-light text-[#faf1db]/80 mt-1">Ostra fresca con perlas de limón y espuma de coco ahumado.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-baseline border-b border-[#faf1db]/20 pb-4 group">
            <div class="w-full md:w-3/4">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#faf1db]/60 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Segundo Tiempo</span>
              <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-yellow-100">Ceviche Thai (Yum Talay)</h4>
              <p class="text-sm font-light text-[#faf1db]/80 mt-1">Mariscos en infusión de lemongrass, chile ojo de pájaro y menta fresca.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-baseline border-b border-[#faf1db]/20 pb-4 group">
            <div class="w-full md:w-3/4">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#faf1db]/60 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Tercer Tiempo (Plato Principal)</span>
              <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-yellow-100">Curry Massaman de Pato Confitado</h4>
              <p class="text-sm font-light text-[#faf1db]/80 mt-1">Acompañado de puré de camote especiado y brotes de cilantro de nuestro huerto.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-baseline border-b border-[#faf1db]/20 pb-4 group">
            <div class="w-full md:w-3/4">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#faf1db]/60 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Cuarto Tiempo (Pre-postre)</span>
              <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-yellow-100">Sorbete de Mango Biche</h4>
              <p class="text-sm font-light text-[#faf1db]/80 mt-1">Para limpiar el paladar, con un toque ligero de sal marina y chile.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-baseline pb-4 group">
            <div class="w-full md:w-3/4">
              <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#faf1db]/60 uppercase tracking-widest block mb-1">Quinto Tiempo (Postre)</span>
              <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-yellow-100">Texturas de Coco y Pandan</h4>
              <p class="text-sm font-light text-[#faf1db]/80 mt-1">Bizcocho tibio de pandan, helado de coco joven y crujiente de sésamo blanco.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <div class="text-center mt-12 pt-10 border-t border-[#faf1db]/20">
          <p class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-2">$120 USD</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#faf1db]/70 mb-8 font-light">Por persona (Incluye maridaje con vinos seleccionados)</p>
          <a href="/reservar" class="inline-block bg-[#faf1db] text-[#028598] px-10 py-4 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-white transition-all shadow-md hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1">
            Reservar una Mesa
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="animate-fade-in-up">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="h-64 rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-lg group">
            <img src="/dish-1.webp" alt="Platillo 1" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" />
          </div>
          <div class="h-64 rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-lg group md:mt-12">
            <img src="/dish-2.webp" alt="Platillo 2" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" />
          </div>
          <div class="h-64 rounded-[2.5rem] overflow-hidden shadow-lg group">
            <img src="/dish-3.webp" alt="Platillo 3" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-110" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>